{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>YHWH</b> — In my opinion: \"in Him I trusted\" alone, and my helpers are many, for He commanded them." "<b>And from my song</b> — like <b>in my song</b>, reversed, and the remainder is like בשר and לחם. And R. Moses the Kohen said: this song is more exceedingly praiseworthy."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:49.191866216Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}